# The pre-build specifications stay local; the living record ships.
#
# Tracked:   product statement, roadmap, journal, ADRs.
# Untracked: PRD, FRD, technical design, UX spec, data model, the planning
#            roadmap and the backend spec — these are working documents, and
#            what they decided is recorded in docs/adr/ instead.
docs/*
!docs/00-PRODUCT-STATEMENT.md
!docs/ROADMAP.md
!docs/JOURNAL.md
!docs/FEATURE-BACKLOG.md
!docs/adr/
!docs/screenshots/

